.page printenv 1 print environment variables

# SYNOPSIS
*printenv* [_NAME_...]

# DESCRIPTION
Without arguments `printenv` prints the whole environment. With names it prints just their values, one per line.

# EXIT STATUS
0, or 1 if any of the names is not set.

# EXAMPLES
    printenv HOME
    printenv PATH EDITOR PAGER

# SEE ALSO
env(1), export(1)
